<div type="jArticle">                     <head><hi rendition="#fr">Berlin.</hi></head>                     <p>Jm Verlag Chri&#x017F;t. Eottl. Nicolai hat<lb/>
Herr Friedr. Wilhelm Roloff                         Herrn <hi rendition="#aq">Henr. Stepha-<lb/>
ni Admonitionem de abu&#x017F;u                             linguæ græeæ in quibus-<lb/>
